1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,974
This is the investor's screen.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,278
In the top bar, we have our notifications…

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,843
…our profile settings, and the language toggle.

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,148
For each project, we see its location and its status.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,278
We can search for projects on a map…

6
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,104
…or by keyword…

7
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:15,409
…and filter them by several criteria.

8
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:29,800
We can save any project to our favorites…

9
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:35,148
…and find them later in the sidebar on the left.

10
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:49,322
Inside a project, we see its name, a cover image, its status and its location.

11
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:57,887
We can also see its documents, each one with its fingerprint anchored on Cardano.

12
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,843
Each document can be opened and downloaded.

13
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:12,843
Below, the project's progress, stage by stage.

14
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:21,452
This is the developer's profile: a description, their track record, and their projects.

15
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:29,583
Each project shows its price, its floor area and its status.

16
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:43,278
"Units" takes us to the units we've bought.

17
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:56,583
Each unit has its image gallery, its location and its details…

18
00:02:57,000 --> 00:03:00,409
…its progress, and the purchase amount.

19
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:11,800
We can also follow every stage, all the way down to the proof behind each one: its Merkle root and its transaction.

20
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:17,583
And the contract, with its total amount and its signing date.

21
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:29,191
"Buy" takes us back to the screen we saw at the start, with the projects on sale.

22
00:03:34,880 --> 00:03:37,854
This is the developer panel.

23
00:03:39,880 --> 00:03:45,463
From the sidebar on the left, we can open our projects.

24
00:03:53,880 --> 00:03:59,897
Under Capital, we see the total raised and the number of investors.

25
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:08,593
In Progress, we follow each project, stage by stage.

26
00:04:19,880 --> 00:04:25,028
Back on the panel, these cards show the key metrics.

27
00:04:29,880 --> 00:04:33,723
Below, we can list all our investors.

28
00:04:39,880 --> 00:04:43,723
We can see all the anchored evidence.

29
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:05,723
And we can see the audit log.

30
00:05:17,880 --> 00:05:20,854
Let's create a new project.

31
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:30,419
We choose a name.

32
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:39,028
We can enter the exact address, or use the map.

33
00:05:49,880 --> 00:05:53,289
We choose the number of units.

34
00:05:53,880 --> 00:05:58,593
We confirm the stage template: the standard ten stages.

35
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:03,289
We set the estimated delivery date.

36
00:06:15,880 --> 00:06:19,289
We attach the project's cover image.

37
00:06:27,880 --> 00:06:30,854
And we click Create project.

38
00:06:35,910 --> 00:06:38,884
Back on the developer panel.

39
00:06:40,910 --> 00:06:44,319
Our new project is already listed.

40
00:06:46,910 --> 00:06:49,884
It starts at zero percent.

41
00:06:55,910 --> 00:06:59,753
In Progress, the delivered towers are complete.

42
00:07:07,910 --> 00:07:12,188
The new project has ten stages, all pending.

43
00:07:19,910 --> 00:07:22,884
Let's open the project again.

44
00:07:26,910 --> 00:07:29,884
First, we add a unit.

45
00:07:31,910 --> 00:07:36,623
Unit 5B, on the fifth floor, 85 square meters.

46
00:07:43,910 --> 00:07:46,884
It shows up as available.

47
00:07:55,910 --> 00:07:58,884
Now we invite a buyer.

48
00:08:01,910 --> 00:08:04,884
We enter the buyer's email…

49
00:08:07,910 --> 00:08:09,580
…the unit…

50
00:08:10,910 --> 00:08:13,014
…and the amount.

51
00:08:16,910 --> 00:08:19,449
We send the invitation.

52
00:08:19,910 --> 00:08:22,884
Unit 5B is now reserved.

53
00:08:29,910 --> 00:08:34,188
Now we upload evidence for the first stage.

54
00:08:38,910 --> 00:08:41,449
We select stage one.

55
00:08:41,910 --> 00:08:44,449
We choose the files.

56
00:09:02,910 --> 00:09:05,884
Three documents, ready to anchor.

57
00:09:08,910 --> 00:09:11,449
We click Anchor evidence.

58
00:09:14,910 --> 00:09:18,319
The evidence is anchored on Cardano.

59
00:09:20,910 --> 00:09:24,753
We can check it on the explorer.

60
00:09:26,910 --> 00:09:30,319
This is the transaction on Cardanoscan.

61
00:09:35,910 --> 00:09:38,449
Back in the app.

62
00:09:44,910 --> 00:09:46,145
Done.

63
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:54,849
Now we switch to the investor.

64
00:09:56,440 --> 00:09:58,979
A new notification arrives.

65
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:03,283
It's an invitation to buy unit 5B.

66
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:17,023
We open the invitation: the project, the unit and the amount.

67
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:20,240
The invitation is anchored on chain.

68
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:22,544
We accept it.

69
00:10:24,440 --> 00:10:27,414
Unit 5B is now ours.

70
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:37,153
The gallery shows the cover and the evidence images.

71
00:10:47,440 --> 00:10:50,414
Its location on the map.

72
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:56,849
The unit details and its progress.

73
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:05,240
The news: the invitation, the stage in progress, and the anchored evidence.

74
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:08,414
Its place in the building.

75
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:20,414
Below, the contract and payments.

76
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:31,153
The contract: the total amount and the signing date.

77
00:11:35,740 --> 00:11:37,844
Now the certifier.

78
00:11:38,740 --> 00:11:42,149
One stage is assigned for review.

79
00:11:42,740 --> 00:11:47,453
Stage one, with the evidence uploaded by the developer.

80
00:11:50,740 --> 00:11:55,018
Something is missing, so we observe the stage.

81
00:11:55,740 --> 00:12:00,018
We write what the developer needs to fix.

82
00:12:04,740 --> 00:12:07,279
We send the observation.

83
00:12:10,740 --> 00:12:13,279
Back to the developer.

84
00:12:16,740 --> 00:12:20,149
The stage now shows as observed.

85
00:12:23,740 --> 00:12:26,279
We resume the stage.

86
00:12:30,740 --> 00:12:33,714
The certifier reviews it again.

87
00:12:38,740 --> 00:12:41,540
This time, we certify the stage.

88
00:12:41,740 --> 00:12:44,714
The certification goes on chain.

89
00:12:46,740 --> 00:12:49,714
The stage leaves the queue.

90
00:12:52,740 --> 00:12:56,583
And it appears among the issued certificates.

91
00:13:03,710 --> 00:13:07,988
Back with the investor, on the delivered tower.

92
00:13:08,710 --> 00:13:12,119
Unit 1A, in Torre Volumen 3.

93
00:13:14,710 --> 00:13:17,684
Its details and its progress.

94
00:13:23,710 --> 00:13:26,510
At the end, the dossier.

95
00:13:26,710 --> 00:13:32,293
The dossier hash is still pending: nobody has signed it yet.

96
00:13:32,710 --> 00:13:35,684
It lists every anchored artifact.

97
00:13:38,710 --> 00:13:42,988
We can share it with a read-only link.

98
00:13:47,710 --> 00:13:51,553
Anyone with the link can open it.

99
00:13:53,710 --> 00:13:57,119
The public view, without logging in.

100
00:13:59,710 --> 00:14:03,988
The same hashes, still waiting for a signature.

101
00:14:08,710 --> 00:14:10,814
Now the notary.

102
00:14:11,710 --> 00:14:15,119
One dossier is waiting for review.

103
00:14:17,710 --> 00:14:20,684
The notary reviews every artifact.

104
00:14:28,710 --> 00:14:31,249
And signs the dossier.

105
00:14:31,710 --> 00:14:34,510
The signature goes on chain.

106
00:14:34,710 --> 00:14:37,684
The dossier is now signed.

107
00:14:42,210 --> 00:14:45,010
The dossier is now signed.

108
00:14:45,210 --> 00:14:49,010
Anyone can check it, without an account.

109
00:14:49,210 --> 00:14:52,010
This is the shared link, in a private window.

110
00:14:52,210 --> 00:14:56,488
It now shows as signed, with its hash.

111
00:14:58,640 --> 00:15:01,179
Back with the developer.

112
00:15:03,640 --> 00:15:06,179
We open the project.

113
00:15:09,640 --> 00:15:13,483
Ten percent done, and its first buyer.

114
00:15:15,640 --> 00:15:19,918
The contract for unit 5B, recorded on chain.

115
00:15:23,510 --> 00:15:26,049
Finally, the audit log.

116
00:15:30,510 --> 00:15:35,223
Every action, with who did it and its transaction.

117
00:15:36,510 --> 00:15:39,484
We can filter by stage…

118
00:15:44,510 --> 00:15:46,614
…or by signatures.

119
00:15:52,510 --> 00:15:55,049
Back to all events.

120
00:16:00,510 --> 00:16:03,484
Each transaction can be verified…

121
00:16:08,510 --> 00:16:11,484
…on Cardanoscan, outside the app.
